comment.body:
Fixed. The reset is now in a `finally` block around the reload so it runs on both success and failure paths:

```dart
if (mounted) setState(() => _isLoadingAudio = true);
try {
  final loadedDuration = ...;
  _loadedSoundId = sound.id;
  // backfill duration...
} finally {
  if (mounted) setState(() => _isLoadingAudio = false);
}
```

